From: Gabe Hope <15705900+gabehope@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 20:02:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Export lax.scatter(updates, indices, shape), the inverse of
 take

The Scatter primitive (a routine on cpu, wasm and webgpu) was reachable
only through the transpose of gather. lax.scatter puts slices of
updates along an axis at 1D int32 indices in a zero-filled array of
shape: "update" writes, "add" accumulates, and indices outside the
axis are skipped, so -1 can mark an update that goes nowhere.
heatmaptest keeps per-row state in source-row order with it (TODO 28).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/library/lax.ts | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/lax.test.ts   | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 73 insertions(+)

